Exceptions (not covered by either licence above):

  - Official U.S. government data (the USCIS files archived under data/raw/ and the numbers
    derived from them) are works of the U.S. Government and are not subject to copyright in the
    United States. Source: USCIS.
  - Fields derived from third-party projects keep their own terms. In particular, the
    processing-time history derived from github.com/jzebedee/uscis (which has no LICENSE file)
    is used for derived fields only, with attribution, pending the maintainer's permission
